Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.31,0:00:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.04,0:01:35.01,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364,760)}Off the Coast \Nof Laboratory 8
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.48,0:01:59.99,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(952,976)}{\fad(200,1500)}"Cruel Fate -\NKuma's Decision as a Father"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.56,0:01:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cruel fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.06,0:01:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's decision as a father.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.32,0:02:05.24,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Justice"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here on business, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.16,0:02:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's awfully cold here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing like Punk Hazard at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Climate aside, this is where the future\Nof mankind itself will be created.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.36,0:02:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, dealing with the constant flow\Nof ideas is my biggest issue right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.90,0:02:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been too distracted to notice\Nsome of the finer points of this lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.04,0:02:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what the issue is.\NNot a word gets past us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially not any secret\Ndeals with pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare stop Borsalino.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't stand this side of you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not personal, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you this is business
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this Porcelino?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.37,0:03:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the lab now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Vega? Punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.36,0:03:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.44,0:03:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know our priorities are\Ndifferent, but have some sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma is strong. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He would make a fine base\Nfor your clone soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he is a pirate\Nwanted for $296 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man like that cannot serve\Nas a symbol of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.30,0:03:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of the Navy's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.86,0:03:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care about saving face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the project succeeds, we'll be\Nsaving lives, far more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.40,0:03:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hardly ignore the\Npotential of such an endeavor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assuming that you can see it to fruition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, I have terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you're listening, my first demand is\Nthat you join the seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recently,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.26,0:04:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a rookie named Ace took one of them down,\Nand we've been looking for a replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pirate world is in a state of chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a man of your\Ncaliber to rein it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in addition to the clones, you yourself\Nmust become a human weapon for the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying I'd become a cyborg?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then as a warlord, you could triumph\Nagainst any pirate in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd make me safer, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want that, don't you, friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Kizaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma, you also have history\Nwith the Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, that is a clear\Nconflict of interest for the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which brings me to my third condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the process ends, your mind\Nand free will will be erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is nothing but a\Nglorified death sentence!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this because the other\Nwarlords won't obey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cyborg without free will\Nis a soulless robot! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turn me into a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.62,0:05:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are in no position to argue with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.38,0:05:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are a Navy scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are the conditions for saving\Nthe life of a criminal's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do not accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we will not spend a fortune on\Nsurgeries to save some insignificant girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, no running in the lab, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.86,0:06:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is wrong. It's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Performing such an\Noperation would be inhumane.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to do it, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was going to\Nmake impossible demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.24,0:06:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that I wouldn't\Nbe able to save my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have nothing more to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can help Bonney get well,\Nthen I'll happily accept any fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.74,0:06:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru, about the matter we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little brat, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk, how long until Kuma is modified\Nand his daughter's treatment is complete?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sapphire scale surgeries\Nwill take six months and then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.76,0:07:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll have to wait another\Nyear before she can go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.52,0:07:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma's modifications\Nshould take two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.42,0:07:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means body will be better\Nbefore her 10th birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter will be our hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once she recovers, you will\Nhave no reason to obey us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could take her and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.30,0:07:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't run, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't be too safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When her surgeries are complete,\Nwe'll take custody of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as your free will is gone,\Nthen she will be allowed to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kuma won't be able to see\Nher after she gets married!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.90,0:07:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is what will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.62,0:07:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll perform Kuma's surgeries while\Nhe serves as one of the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.92,0:08:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once his daughter is cured, he will\Nbe forbidden to contact her or escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that rule is violated, she'll\Nbe sent off to become a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never see her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have just one request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.62,0:08:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want her to know the truth about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her disease or the fact\Nthat she's a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So after her surgeries don't make\Nher stay at some government facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I Want you to let her\Nrest at the church in the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorbet kingdom where she grew up\NNothing more, but right. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.36,0:08:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never go there to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do exactly as you command.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where she's under watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.94,0:08:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These next two years will be interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:08:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you bored?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.32,0:09:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you were a good girl. Always!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.94,0:09:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, we're staying here for\Nthe next six months. We are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.82,0:09:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be here with me? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out you're not the\Nonly one who needs treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.16,0:09:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.10,0:09:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll get better together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, this weird guy is Saint Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she can be quite the handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.80,0:09:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine. I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is like a big maze\Nand it doesn't have any windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, were you running around on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.46,0:09:58.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just a chicken. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:09:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sneak off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have dreams to fulfill!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands can't keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.62,0:10:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must chronicle these endless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ideas for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.66,0:10:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat for me, go to the bathroom for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seizes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can someone help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a cat would do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.30,0:10:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there were five more of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sentomaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.14,0:10:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You busy? Let's play!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.70,0:11:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're bored, but I don't have\Ntime to hang out with you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.92,0:11:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi there, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.34,0:11:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of father are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your daughter has no sense of modesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing horsey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your horse looks so friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, maybe you should let him\Ngo back to the stable. Okie Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think she gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why do you have marks all over you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.70,0:12:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfect I'll treasure\Nthis for the rest of my life
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.00,0:12:39.50,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Dad"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I was just about to come get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.42,0:13:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.60,0:13:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.43,0:13:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Dad, let's do the thing! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doom da da da!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.82,0:13:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doom da da da!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Nita dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, try it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.20,0:14:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.11,0:14:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the Sanji for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's a wallflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.67,0:14:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.29,0:14:43.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962,978)}{\fad(0,400)}Six Months Later
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you're looking great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.90,0:14:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more year and you'll\Nbe in perfect health.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.90,0:14:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.68,0:15:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, once I get better,\Ncan I come visit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.84,0:15:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the sea pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no fair. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to see it soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and me together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.26,0:15:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.13,0:15:30.76,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(430,588)}Sorbet Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.20,0:15:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.72,0:15:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been ages!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to live here again? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My disease will be all gone in a year!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can finally go outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were sad you'd get better before you\Nwere ten and it seems you were right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is someone in need of a babysitter again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All bad Conney!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.57,0:15:59.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1592,622)}Queen Dowager Conney, \NSorbet Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be happy to take\Ncare of Kuma, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave everything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.66,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful, you've all been too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.84,0:16:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a pirate now, so if I stick around,\Nit might cause trouble for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll likely be over a year\Nuntil I can come back? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so long. How about\NI write you letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.62,0:16:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I pick you up, we'll take to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From there, it's an endless horizon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.26,0:16:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go all kinds\Nof places. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take you anywhere you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only that were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in good hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.45,0:16:48.67,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,664)}Alpha, an Intelligence Agent \NCipher Pol No.8
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Per the doctor's orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be staying with Bonney until her\Ntreatment's done and she's all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.06,0:16:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every day I'll check her temperature,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,give her medicine, and\Nmonitor everything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.02,0:16:55.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.46,0:16:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Nurse Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that in front of the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where Bonnie will be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this hospital doesn't\Nallow any suspicious visitors,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so make sure you always carry your IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One toe out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.12,0:17:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll snap her little neck.\NI know. I'll never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye Bonnie and thank you\Nthank you for being born.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and thus the tyrant became a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.58,0:18:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bartholomew kuma was obedient to his\Norders from the world government.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.69,0:18:38.49,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Seven Warlords of the Sea"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it made him a force to be reckoned\Nwith for pirates across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,young master it says here\Nthere's a new warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma the Tyrant, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The seas are full of villains.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's one more, I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you interested in the new warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now tell me, did you eliminate the\Nrat who saw our rainmaking ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flawlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say he's as tall as Whitebeard. So\Nwhich one of us do you think is stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, of course, Lady Alvida?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinbe! They found a replacement already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.04,0:19:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.86,0:19:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from you, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who beat Hina Buddha and\Ncaused this mess in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does the new guy meet\Nyour lofty standards or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.32,0:19:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to figure that out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man's a former king?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose he won't be the\Nonly royalty in the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world of pirates\Ncertainly has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is of no concern to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not be going to\NCentral no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:07.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such ignorance ill suits\Nthe ruler of our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.28,0:20:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, sissy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says he has paw pad powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.30,0:20:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to be scared of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he wouldn't be a warlord\Nif he was weak, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.86,0:20:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the warlords work directly\Nunder the government, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the Kuma I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Bonnie, I'm riding\Nyou for my ship at sea.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.15,0:20:42.86,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,"Dad"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've become a bit infamous,\Nso it's harder to travel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's a bit far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.74,0:20:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to find all sorts of places that\Nyou and I can visit once you turn ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bartholomew Koala, you have a\Nnew order from the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.56,0:21:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.42,0:22:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.

